{"parse":{"title":"Wiktionary:Word of the day/2026/November 16","pageid":13587905,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r87233645\">.mw-parser-output .mf-wotd>.wotd-container{margin-top:-47px}.mw-parser-output .mf-fwotd>.wotd-container{margin-top:-36px}.mw-parser-output .wotd-container{background:var(--wikt-palette-lighterblue,#ebf4ff);border:3px solid var(--wikt-palette-dulllightblue,#aabbdd)}.mw-parser-output .wotd-header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--wikt-palette-grey,#9e9e9e)}</style><div class=\"mf-wotd\" title=\"Word of the day\"><span style=\"position:relative; left:-10px; top:-10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/katabasis#English\" title=\"katabasis\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Writing_star.svg/120px-Writing_star.svg.png?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"62\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Writing_star.svg/250px-Writing_star.svg.png?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"580\" data-file-height=\"470\"/></a></span></span>\n<table class=\"wotd-container\" style=\"width:100%; padding:10px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div style=\"float:right;\" class=\"plainlinks\"><small class=\"editlink\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wiktionary.org/w/index.php?title=Wiktionary:Word_of_the_day/2026/November_16&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/w/index.php?title=Wiktionary:Word_of_the_day/2026/November_16&amp;action=edit\">edit</a></small><small class=\"editlink\"> · <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//en.wiktionary.org/w/index.php?title=Wiktionary:Word_of_the_day/2026/November_16&amp;action=purge\" href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/w/index.php?title=Wiktionary:Word_of_the_day/2026/November_16&amp;action=purge\">refresh</a> · <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">view</a></small></div><div class=\"wotd-header\" style=\"font-size:150%; padding-left:40px;\">Word of the day<span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\"><br/>for <span id=\"WOTD-rss-date\">November 16</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/katabasis#English\" title=\"katabasis\"><span id=\"WOTD-rss-title\">katabasis</span></a></b> <i>n</i>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><div style=\"float:right\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><audio id=\"mwe_player_0\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" data-mw-tmh=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" width=\"250\" style=\"width:250px;\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"LL-Q1860_(eng)-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_(NaomiAmethyst)-katabasis.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"wikimediacommons\"><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-katabasis.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-katabasis.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\"/><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-katabasis.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-katabasis.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\"/></audio></span></span></div><div id=\"WOTD-rss-description\">\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/military\" title=\"military\">military</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#historical\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">historical</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#literary\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">literary</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> A <a href=\"/wiki/retreat#Noun\" title=\"retreat\">retreat</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/military#Adjective\" title=\"military\">military</a> <a href=\"/wiki/force#Noun\" title=\"force\">forces</a>; specifically, that of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyrus_the_Younger\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Cyrus the Younger\">Cyrus the Younger</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/troop#Noun\" title=\"troop\">troops</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Asia\" title=\"Asia\">Asia</a> back to <a href=\"/wiki/Greece\" title=\"Greece\">Greece</a> in 401–399 <small class=\"ce-date\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#BCE\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\"><span title=\"Glossary and display preference\">B.C.E.</span></a></small>; also <span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\">generally<span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span> often <a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#humorous\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">humorous</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span>, a retreat of any <a href=\"/wiki/kind#Noun\" title=\"kind\">kind</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\">by extension</span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span>\n<ol><li>A <a href=\"/wiki/journey#Noun\" title=\"journey\">journey</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/interior#Noun\" title=\"interior\">interior</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/country#Noun\" title=\"country\">country</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/coast#Noun\" title=\"coast\">coast</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/literature\" title=\"literature\">literature</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span> <a href=\"/wiki/mythology\" title=\"mythology\">mythology</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> A <a href=\"/wiki/mytheme\" title=\"mytheme\">mytheme</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/trope#Noun\" title=\"trope\">trope</a> in which the <a href=\"/wiki/hero#Noun\" title=\"hero\">hero</a> <a href=\"/wiki/embar\" title=\"embar\">embarks</a> on a journey to the <a href=\"/wiki/underworld\" title=\"underworld\">underworld</a>.\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#humorous\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">humorous</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> Any journey <a href=\"/wiki/downwards#Adjective\" title=\"downwards\">downwards</a>; a <a href=\"/wiki/descent\" title=\"descent\">descent</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/fall#Noun\" title=\"fall\">fall</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/climatology\" title=\"climatology\">climatology</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#rare\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">rare</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> A <a href=\"/wiki/presence#Noun\" title=\"presence\">presence</a> of <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/katabatic_wind#English\" title=\"katabatic wind\">katabatic winds</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/wind#Noun\" title=\"wind\">winds</a> which <a href=\"/wiki/move#Verb\" title=\"move\">move</a> <a href=\"/wiki/high-density\" title=\"high-density\">high-density</a> <a href=\"/wiki/air#Noun\" title=\"air\">air</a> from a <a href=\"/wiki/high#Adjective\" title=\"high\">higher</a> <a href=\"/wiki/elevation\" title=\"elevation\">elevation</a> down an <a href=\"/wiki/incline#Noun\" title=\"incline\">incline</a> due to the <a href=\"/wiki/force#Noun\" title=\"force\">force</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/gravity\" title=\"gravity\">gravity</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.</li></ol></li></ol></li></ol>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; font-size:80%; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Word_of_the_day/2026/November_15\" title=\"Wiktionary:Word of the day/2026/November 15\">← yesterday</a> | <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r89131476\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-li,.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-elt{display:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after{content:\": \"}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:first-child:before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li li:first-child:before{content:\" (\";font-weight:normal}.mw-parser-output .